      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements:\n- Create an auction\n- Bid in an auction\n- View auction detail and bid history\n\nScale:\n- 10M concurrent auctions\n\nNon-Functional requirements\n- Strong Consistency for auction bids\n- Fault tolerant (can't drop bids)\n- Realtime client updates in bid history\n- Scale to 10M concurrent auctions",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements:\n- Create an auction\n- Bid in an auction\n- View auction detail and bid history\n\nScale:\n- 10M concurrent auctions\n\nNon-Functional requirements\n- Strong Consistency for auction bids\n- Fault tolerant (can't drop bids)\n- Realtime client updates in bid history\n- Scale to 10M concurrent auctions",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
