    },
    {
      "id": "k_5kWzBqS3OPcNBnasSfv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 643.2066988004908,
      "y": 1800.127778625261,
      "width": 676.8203124999999,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 228965576,
      "version": 669,
      "versionNonce": 2030528696,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793633348228,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What do we want here?\n- Transaction and serializability between 2 bid request at a same\ntime on a same auction\n- We want to ensure below (current max bid is 10$)\n    - 20$: read current max -> 10\n    - Add 20$ bid with status accepted and update the max bid\n    - 10$: read current max -> 20$ instance of 10$\n    - Add 10$ bid with status rejected\n\nWe can achieve this using pessimistic lock\npsuedo-code:\nBEGIN;\n0. lock the auction row\n1. read the maxBid column\n2. add the new big row withs status\n3. update the maxBid on the auction row if needed\n4. release the row lock\nCOMMIT;",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What do we want here?\n- Transaction and serializability between 2 bid request at a same time on a same auction\n- We want to ensure below (current max bid is 10$)\n    - 20$: read current max -> 10\n    - Add 20$ bid with status accepted and update the max bid\n    - 10$: read current max -> 20$ instance of 10$\n    - Add 10$ bid with status rejected\n\nWe can achieve this using pessimistic lock\npsuedo-code:\nBEGIN;\n0. lock the auction row\n1. read the maxBid column\n2. add the new big row withs status\n3. update the maxBid on the auction row if needed\n4. release the row lock\nCOMMIT;",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
